{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The demo features the first </i></strong>~<strong><i>30 minutes of the full game, including the first 15 photographs and 3 videos for analysis, plus 3 first-person exploration sections in Eli's house. For full game features, see below:</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your best friend Eli is convinced his family is being haunted.\u00a0At first you don't believe him. But then he shows you the photos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eli's parents dismiss it as an overactive imagination. He needs clearer evidence. As a budding photo editor, that's where you come in.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Walls Have Eyes... and Faces</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107750/extras/4de8b78fcbbf36cc5088005dc464b689.poster.avif?t=1760508972\" width=800 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107750/extras/4de8b78fcbbf36cc5088005dc464b689.webm?t=1760508972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107750/extras/4de8b78fcbbf36cc5088005dc464b689.mp4?t=1760508972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the latest\u00a0<i>SpectralAware\u2122 2.1</i>\u00a0software to analyze Eli's family photos and home videos. Adjust the exposure, contrast and noise, and apply different filters to reveal the horrors hiding in plain sight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choices Have Consequences</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107750/extras/050bb148bb483321c668e13b48ed322e.poster.avif?t=1760508972\" width=800 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107750/extras/050bb148bb483321c668e13b48ed322e.webm?t=1760508972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107750/extras/050bb148bb483321c668e13b48ed322e.mp4?t=1760508972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the help of a detailed manual, sort your findings into different categories - Apparitions, Simulacra, Strange Lights, Demonic Entities, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's vital you get it right, as mistakes carry consequences - the fate of Eli and his family rests on your answers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hereditary Horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107750/extras/1b8269b7c816150946810e958856c540.poster.avif?t=1760508972\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107750/extras/1b8269b7c816150946810e958856c540.webm?t=1760508972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107750/extras/1b8269b7c816150946810e958856c540.mp4?t=1760508972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the family's history - and, if you're observant - the true reason behind the hauntings, inherited and handed down from generation to generation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between photo investigations, explore the house in tense first-person sections where the consequences of your actions bleed  into the present-day.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107750/extras/ff8f686f46520c1998317f84c77eab4f.poster.avif?t=1760508972\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107750/extras/ff8f686f46520c1998317f84c77eab4f.webm?t=1760508972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107750/extras/ff8f686f46520c1998317f84c77eab4f.mp4?t=1760508972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Slow-Burn Horror Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by <i>Her Story</i>, <i>Mouthwashing, Home Safety Hotline</i>, and Kiyoshi Kurosawa's masterpiece horror film <i>Pulse</i> (2001), <strong>this is true psychological horror that lingers <i>long after</i>\u00a0you've logged off. You may feel you're being watched in your own home. Are you up for it?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Full game features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An in-game computer with\u00a0<i>SpectralAware\u2122 2.1 </i>- a photo and video analysis tool for detecting the paranormal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >90+ haunting photos and video clips that dig through a hidden, multi-generational narrative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person sections in the house where the present-day  horror turns to immediate terror around you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharp, gripping and cathartic storytelling from Frostwood Interactive (<i>Rainswept</i>, <i>Unwording</i>)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An early-2000s style OS with Frutiger Aero aesthetics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4107750?t=1760508972","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4107750?t=1760508972","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107750/9ae2270bf13f66bddd08b9823c2265d1451a9d33/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760508972","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107750/9ae2270bf13f66bddd08b9823c2265d1451a9d33/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760508972","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Contains topics and imagery that some players may find disturbing such as depictions of ghosts and the supernatural."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The demo features the first </i></strong>~<strong><i>30 minutes of the full game, including the first 15 photographs and 3 videos for analysis, plus 3 first-person exploration sections in Eli's house. For full game features, see below:</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your best friend Eli is convinced his family is being haunted.\u00a0At first you don't believe him. But then he shows you the photos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eli's parents dismiss it as an overactive imagination. He needs clearer evidence. As a budding photo editor, that's where you come in.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Walls Have Eyes... and Faces</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107750/extras/4de8b78fcbbf36cc5088005dc464b689.poster.avif?t=1760508972\" width=800 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107750/extras/4de8b78fcbbf36cc5088005dc464b689.webm?t=1760508972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107750/extras/4de8b78fcbbf36cc5088005dc464b689.mp4?t=1760508972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the latest\u00a0<i>SpectralAware\u2122 2.1</i>\u00a0software to analyze Eli's family photos and 