ded down from generation to generation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between photo investigations, explore the house in tense first-person sections where the consequences of your actions bleed  into the present-day.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107750/extras/ff8f686f46520c1998317f84c77eab4f.poster.avif?t=1760508972\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107750/extras/ff8f686f46520c1998317f84c77eab4f.webm?t=1760508972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107750/extras/ff8f686f46520c1998317f84c77eab4f.mp4?t=1760508972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Slow-Burn Horror Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by <i>Her Story</i>, <i>Mouthwashing, Home Safety Hotline</i>, and Kiyoshi Kurosawa's masterpiece horror film <i>Pulse</i> (2001), <strong>this is true psychological horror that lingers <i>long after</i>\u00a0you've logged off. You may feel you're being watched in your own home. Are you up for it?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Full game features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An in-game computer with\u00a0<i>SpectralAware\u2122 2.1 </i>- a photo and video analysis tool for detecting the paranormal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >90+ haunting photos and video clips that dig through a hidden, multi-generational narrative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person sections in the house where the present-day  horror turns to immediate terror around you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharp, gripping and cathartic storytelling from Frostwood Interactive (<i>Rainswept</i>, <i>Unwording</i>)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An early-2000s style OS with Frutiger Aero aesthetics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p>","developers":["Frostwood Interactive"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3798860","name":"Shutter Story"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107750/ce5c07e6ea0f6e993f4b88d490656f2460be81f8/header.jpg?t=1760508972","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4107750/1420296010/34e20a95e305384b020870b6be8fbeae8749edbb/1760348214/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760508971","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4107750/1420296010/34e20a95e305384b020870b6be8fbeae8749edbb/1760348214/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760508971","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4107750/1420296010/34e20a95e305384b020870b6be8fbeae8749edbb/1760348214/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760508971","id":257216834,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257216834/movie480.mp4?t=1760508971","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257216834/movie_max.mp4?t=1760508971"},"name":"Shutter Story - Updated Announce Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257216834/7acd7afa6d0d77e6bc811845aaa78e47d7a88e03/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760508971","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257216834/movie480.webm?t=1760508971","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257216834/movie_max.