ort_description":"Examine a family's photo album to reveal signs of the paranormal, as the horror unfolds in the house around you. Their fate is in your hands.","steam_appid":4107750,"support_info":{"email":"armaan@frostwoodinteractive.com","url":"http://www.frostwoodinteractive.com/"},"supported_languages":"English","type":"demo","website":"http://www.frostwoodinteractive.com/"}